", "id": "569025656185476", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473397316_569025659518809_1129938089592913200_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MVJ9yHzcXRMQ7kNvwFfaz57&_nc_oc=Adk2ljCBPnU8FMmrMvmwcCbtsSeX8XZ4v7TUkysMb156HhIRu-wBkDazJkS0a5pF4y8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftSbrOiYzPsFkaMZKOMasKilwMhDkehGTIkRYc_utKsUA&oe=699C3D2A"}]}, "id": "1339729720412434", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Screenshot1.png", "id": "1278859143198705", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391924_1278859146532038_7918403453860968819_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pnjx6qNQNj8Q7kNvwEcHwyq&_nc_oc=Adm7TPdVCrTyDnHtBsNAcJQ2Bq5HRYb8eg9sydK9gHqnz09yGFFXC1FqcB_VULBbMfs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft3eWG64O60RalvsrVJdp5CkIs6gN9taTOKkfG7EIzK4Q&oe=699C5A0D"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "653175777576117", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392019_653175780909450_6665210298574887755_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BlfJJ0zxq2UQ7kNvwHJQRiU&_nc_oc=AdltugjjNw_eghj4mTwSe6UbgbmaY_fHRn9r_F7bcrXu1vTXrlgzbILnsLf84QPTOnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsEvdQqS_fMRReJE3-JGr_if97ayCVKebIP0tmRSKzeTw&oe=699C3B64"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "1813951416117142", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391937_1813951419450475_4779584993365986793_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f2oVokT3lBUQ7kNvwF8GgKD&_nc_oc=AdmJonrNEBp3Tzn-GbqGvcLC0BxAneZUhYu_WCyY5Re1XcS3uWaKCguII1XGStCL3m8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftOVJkD74WPBA1f8h_qI_UgvJQAZV0KANxBQ53Ppj8IeA&oe=699C36DF"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "633923102942349", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_633923109609015_8038197177680033568_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mu7WFH2vJnUQ7kNvwHhO9Mj&_nc_oc=AdnQT45GlsH5k4GjY0lwzqEc4vYntDwn0ho8wF2sE3lDqYpxSqb7fCa0aCdI1THSS6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfswBgYDA_iKMD2sAJOKeFxGItkROddLH_0NRPUTu2KlFA&oe=699C3439"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "1236615407829870", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1236615411163203_6793625200968117992_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gJ5wy62M4DIQ7kNvwHhMdxK&_nc_oc=AdlihxuR6y1cvWcRLWqsuo8r6-hIOCbF-T1Br31c-31gFze0teH2n-nd9zK9B6M_qtc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afubm2n0OhUsl2UMtCcuNScgCkyMnryJymE5iJX8QvHsFg&oe=699C3D4B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImage.png", "id": "1167487215074082", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391883_1167487218407415_8367507673734608742_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XyMAcGdKxvoQ7kNvwGYHxgY&_nc_oc=Adlg_NI6Myw9fKhq2ztTAJDcLCP-cJrtSoDT6y_7OuIqQak4MrJ66hsC_jBD2d6LkRs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuTdD-SS4zRpSLuZqQ0OkZSYotLIZUA086fuO1Gh0d9AA&oe=699C3BDE"}, "display_name": "Magnificent Ships", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Model ship lovers rejoice! This is a collection of six finely-detailed vessels for viewing at both model- and actual-size. Relax and enjoy the Zen-like experience that piloting small boats on liquid provides.  Pick them up for a closer look.  If you desire stimulation, try your hand at competing against a \"ghost-ship\" to capture the most buoys. For fun, try piloting them around inside a house, or even your own living-room via passthrough/mixed-reality.  Leisurely stroll their decks as they sail upon an ocean with dynamic day/night cycle. Each ship includes an \"action\" event while at sea, whereby mighty cannons fire, ship horns bellow, or the submarine dives.\n\nIncluded Ships:\n- Ocean liner: RMS Queen Mary\n- English \"race built\" galleon: The Mermaid (fictional)\n- Zumwalt class destroyer: USS Zumwalt (DDG-1000)\n- Iowa class battleship: USS Iowa (BB-61)\n- Research vessel: RV Calypso\n- German submarine: U-boat Type VII-C/41 (U-659)\n\nDesigned for use with a single controller:\n- Button A/X: change to next ship (long-press for previous)\n- Button B/Y: change to next environment (long-press for previous)\n- Trigger: move in direction controller is pointing.\n- Grip: (model-scale) grab ship , (full-scale) activate action.\n- Thumbstick: (model-scale) control ship, (full-scale) change-time & snap-turn\n- Thumb button: (ship model) double speed, (submarine model) hold to dive, tap to surface", "short_description": "Remote-control model ships in virtual or mixed-reality!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vroom.space/ships/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VROOM.space", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vroom.space/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9025258787583549"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 8, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4211684925740530"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1405002918081508"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1821607738519949"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "880528631403650"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1126976229650763"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "6